the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 8.

the actions are:
    the move a is made; known as a.
    the move b is made; known as b.
    the move c is made; known as c.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    p; known as p.
    q; known as q.
    r; known as r.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    the successor of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base buttonsandlights includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/buttonsandlights.hrf".

the successor of 1 is 2.

the successor of 2 is 3.

the successor of 3 is 4.

the successor of 4 is 5.

the successor of 5 is 6.

the successor of 6 is 7.

